<title>USA: Newell Co Q1 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Newell Co Q1 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, Ill. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.24		   $ 0.21</p>
<p> Net			 37,800		   33,200</p>
<p> Sales		    629,100		  618,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 159,000		  158,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Increased 1997 Q1 earnings due to higher profits at Newell's picture frame businesses.</p>
<p>Increase in net sales reflects January 1996 acquisition of Holson Burnes, March 1997 acquisition of Rolodex, and internal growth.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
